00:09:48.610 --> 00:09:51.890
Once you get into the course,
series of ten weeks,

00:09:51.890 --> 00:09:54.802
you get matched with a partner or
an advisor.

00:09:54.802 --> 00:09:58.822
Our advisor was an awesome individuals,
the ex CMO of eBay and

00:09:58.822 --> 00:10:02.315
