experienced individuals as well.

00:10:16.242 --> 00:10:22.332
And then you go through the process of
the lean startup methodology, right?

00:10:22.332 --> 00:10:26.119
You go, you create hypotheses,
you do test to test them out.

00:10:26.119 --> 00:10:31.084
The school provides resources,
we ran a couple ad campaigns,

00:10:31.084 --> 00:10:36.061
for example, that we got resources
